  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for Investigative Reporting (CIN) - System Audit and Evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Center f&#xF6;r unders&#xF6;kande journalistik (CIN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Four years continued core support to the Center for Investigative     Reporting (CIN) a non-profit media organization with a focus on       organized crime and corruption. The aim is to: a) continue CIN&apos;s core anti-corruption work at international standard b) develop more        effective means to reach readers c)to strengthen the structure of the organization and secure long-term financial sustainability.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fyra&#xE5;rigt st&#xF6;d till Centret f&#xF6;r unders&#xF6;kande journalistik, en icke    vinstdrivande media organisation inriktad p&#xE5; rapportering om          organiserad brottslighet och korruption. Syftet &#xE4;r att fors&#xE4;tta       rapportering med h&#xF6;g standard, utveckla former f&#xF6;r att n&#xE5; fler        l&#xE4;sare, samt s&#xE4;rka &#xC4;CINS administrativa kapacietet och s&#xE4;kra en       l&#xE5;ngsiktig finansiering.</narrative>
  </description>
